Follow `.claude/rules/portability-no-trace.md` (read it first).
@.claude/rules/portability-no-trace.md
Hard rules: every path from `crates/paths`, nothing written outside installDir (no registry,
AppData or real TEMP), no absolute path persisted, no autostart. The portability test is a gate.
